2	// `andesim run --mode fast|cycle|hybrid [engine selection] ELF [-- engine args]`.
3	//
4	// The top selection axis. F7/F8 land the two standalone models, `fast` (QEMU)
5	// and `cycle` (a cycle-accurate engine, from reset): each resolves its
6	// engine, then hands off to transparent passthrough -- the ELF plus everything
7	// after `--` becomes the engine's own command line, run with inherited stdio,
8	// no timeout, and the exit code propagated, so a gdbstub / monitor /
9	// semihosting console all behave as if the engine were invoked directly.
